    <h2>How Outstation Taxi Fares Work</h2>
    <p>Outstation fares are calculated on a per-kilometre basis. Our current indicative rates are:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Car</th><th>Seats</th><th>Rate per km</th><th>Ideal for</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Swift / Indigo</td><td>4</td><td>&#8377;9&ndash;10</td><td>Couples, small families, business trips</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Etios</td><td>4</td><td>&#8377;11&ndash;12</td><td>Extra boot space and comfort</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Ertiga</td><td>6</td><td>&#8377;11&ndash;12</td><td>Families of 5&ndash;6</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Tavera</td><td>9</td><td>&#8377;12&ndash;13</td><td>Larger families and groups</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Innova</td><td>7</td><td>&#8377;14&ndash;15</td><td>Premium comfort on long drives</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Cruiser</td><td>12</td><td>&#8377;15&ndash;16</td><td>Group tours, weddings, pilgrimages</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <p>Besides the per-km charge, keep these in mind when planning your budget:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Round trip vs one way:</strong> Round trips are charged for the total kilometres driven. One-way drops are quoted separately, as the car returns empty.</li>
        <li><strong>Minimum kilometres per day:</strong> Multi-day outstation trips usually carry a minimum daily kilometre charge. Ask us for details when booking.</li>
        <li><strong>Driver allowance:</strong> A daily allowance applies for overnight trips.</li>
        <li><strong>Toll, parking and state tax:</strong> Charged as actuals. Trips to Madhya Pradesh, Gujarat or Delhi may include interstate permit charges.</li>
    </ul>

